# component-architecture

The media card component system implements a specialized content presentation architecture:

## Core Component Structure

`src/components/card-media.astro`:
- Base media card component providing foundational content display
- Conditional rendering between link/span based on href property
- Enforced 16:9 aspect ratio container

`src/components/card-youtube.astro`: 
- Extension of base media card specifically for YouTube content
- Inherits core media card properties
- Adds video embedding capabilities

## Component Relationships

The architecture follows an extension pattern where:
1. Base media cards define the core content structure
2. YouTube cards extend this with video-specific features while maintaining consistent layout rules
3. Both components share aspect ratio and container behaviors

